{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651450/extras/FAV_Steam_Logo.png?t=1746235824\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Developer says:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;This game emphasizes the beauty of combat and sex, inviting players to appreciate and savor the experience from an aesthetic perspective, delivering an unprecedented level of\u00a0 impact.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Innovative &quot;Free-Look-Slow-Motion&quot; system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In order to make players more immersed, we developed this &quot;free perspective slow motion&quot; system. Players can travel around the arena and observe it freely, enjoying every wonderful close-up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651450/extras/FWV_free-looking_image.png?t=1746235824\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Worldview Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the convergence of the Nine Realms known as the &quot;Midgard Rift,&quot; a war that shattered a thousand-year balance is raging. The Valkyries of Norse legend\u2014once Odin's chosen guides of fallen warriors\u2014now find themselves locked in a desperate battle against an infernal legion pouring forth from the abyss, as the prophecy of Ragnar\u00f6k manifests prematurely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leading this demonic onslaught is Loki Shadowflame, a fallen god who has stolen the roots of Yggdrasil, the World Tree, and infused the creatures of the underworld with forbidden chaos magic, transforming them into light-devouring &quot;Eclipseborn.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And you\u2014an unnamed champion summoned by the Valkyrie Queen Brynhildr with her dying divine power\u2014are the key to turning the tide of war\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">In thi